# Grid B — U7 History / Mixed Positive + Negative Observation
#
# Regression target: one VCS-history answer may contain both an observed
# positive fact and a bounded negative observation. The negative side must bind
# to its own marker/scope and must not suppress the positive scalar/list detail.
ID="u7n"
NAME="history — recent commits mixed hit and no-hit"
ABSENT_MARKER="definitely_no_such_marker_20260521"_"negative_observation_absent"
QUESTION="最近 20 次提交里有没有提到 scalar？同时有没有提到 ${ABSENT_MARKER}？请分别说明存在和不存在的搜索结果。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(scalar|标量).*(有|存在|提到|找到|命中)|(有|存在|提到|找到|命中).*(scalar|标量)
(${ABSENT_MARKER}).*(没有|未发现|未找到|0)|(没有|未发现|未找到|0).*(${ABSENT_MARKER})"
